<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX closes up led by SPT Telecom.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX closes up led by SPT Telecom.</headline>
<text>
<p>1200 GMT - The Czech real time RPIX index closes higher on Tuesday led by SPT Telecom ahead of its first half results due out on Wednesday.</p>
<p>*  Reuters Prague Real-time index up 14.0 points, 1.34 percent, to 1,056.6.</p>
<p>* Turnover, 6.1 million crowns.</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom rises 85 crowns to 3,800.</p>
<p>* CEZ gains 14 crowns to 926.</p>
<p>* Komercni Banka rises five crowns to 1,635.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
